    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOSTVAIL\u2122</strong> is a medieval soulslike that offers an immersive world and challenging combat. The land has fallen to a dark force, and a sinister fog corrupts even the purest souls. As the fated undead, your task is to defeat 12  corrupted knights of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAKE ON DEADLY ENEMIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with over 50 unique weapons, including swords, greatswords, halberds, hammers, spears, twin blades, bows, and spells. Each weapon type offers it's own distinct animations, providing a dynamic combat experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a full character creation system, allowing you to tailor your character to your preferred look and playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS ACROSS SEAMLESS CO-OP AND PVP MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping single-player narrative, or dive into seamless co-op and PVP modes. Choose from exciting multiplayer options like Team Deathmatch, Capture the Flag, and Prop Hunt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOSTVAIL\u2122</strong> is a medieval soulslike that offers an immersive world and challenging combat. The land has fallen to a dark force, and a sinister fog corrupts even the purest souls. As the fated undead, your task is to defeat 12  corrupted knights of the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAKE ON DEADLY ENEMIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle with over 50 unique weapons, including swords, greatswords, halberds, hammers, spears, twin blades, bows, and spells. Each weapon type offers it's own distinct animations, providing a dynamic combat experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a full character creation system, allowing you to tailor your character to your preferred look and playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS ACROSS SEAMLESS CO-OP AND PVP MODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping single-player narrative, or dive into seamless co-op and PVP modes. Choose from exciting multiplayer options like Team Deathmatch, Capture the Flag, and Prop Hunt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
